[p]\[ UI ][/p][p]Demo/Replay viewer improvements:[/p][list][*][p]Added a progress bar for demo/replay downloads[/p][/*][*][p]Camera controls now use click-and-drag scheme[/p][/*][*][p]Free and chase camera are usable during a paused demo[/p][/*][*][p]Fixed some minor issues when seeking to a different position in the demo file[/p][/*][/list][p][/p][p]\[ MISC ][/p][list][*][p]Round backup files now require the game server startup flag "-allow_round_backup_files"[/p][/*][*][p]Updated AUG reload animations for standing and crouch reloads to better match new reload duration[/p][/*][*][p]Allowed radio commands now have an explicit list[/p][/*][*][p]Added toolsskybox_occluder tool material for CS2 Workshop Tools[/p][/*][*][p]Stability improvements for Vulkan renderer[/p][/*][/list]
